# esx-investigate

Establish the live failure with exact source/data/environment and a measured
comparison. Decide whether it is an implementation defect, oracle defect, numerical
conditioning, unsupported configuration, dataset mismatch or still unknown.

Reduce inputs while preserving the predicate, masks, boundary geometry and
scientific sensitivity. Compare analytical/manufactured/reference solutions or
an independent implementation when available. Fault injection must be exercised
and detected. Preserve minimum sample counts and finite-value assertions.

Use bisection only after both endpoints and the predicate reproduce. Treat
unbuildable revisions as unresolved. Classify discoveries as introduced regressions,
required dependencies, separate existing defects or unknown. File separate evidence
without silently enlarging the current acceptance scope.
